    ["<Assistant_Title1>城堡</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n玩家自行建造<Assistant_Property2>城堡</>，可在城堡内进行<Assistant_Property1>建造</>、<Assistant_Property1>工坊生产</>、<Assistant_Property1>市场收购</>、<Assistant_Property1>铁路大亨</>等玩法。\n<Assistant_Title2>获得方式：</>\n扮演等级>19级的非凡者，通过完成奇迹的城堡任务解锁城堡，点击<Assistant_System>菜单-城堡</>可回到城堡。\n<Assistant_Title2>城堡升级条件：</>\n1. 当前城堡可升级（城堡最高等级随服务器开服天数逐步开放）。\n2. <Assistant_Property2>城堡总评分</>（城堡组件评分总和）达到指定评分。 \n3. <Assistant_Property2>城堡建造评分</>（城堡实际摆放的组件评分总和）达到指定评分。\n4. 以上条件达成后，再消耗一定<Assistant_Property2>城堡资产</>即可升级。 \n<Assistant_Title2>城堡资产作用：</>\n<Assistant_Property2>城堡资材</>可用于购买家具和城堡升级消耗。\n<Assistant_Title2>城堡资产获得：</>\n1. 任务奖励——完成<Assistant_Property1>铁路大亨</>任务可获得城堡资产。\n2. 市场收购——非凡者可以通过将城堡工坊产出的物产，去他人城堡卖出获得城堡资产。\n<Assistant_Title2>城堡资产存储：</>\n1. 城堡可获得资产有每周上限，超过可获得上限的资产将无法累计；同理，超过城堡存储资产上限也将无法累计。\n2. 每周可获得资产、城堡资产存储上限将随城堡等级一并提升。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Castle</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions: </>\nPlayers can build their own <Assistant_Property2>Castle</>, where they can engage in <Assistant_Property1>Construction</>, <Assistant_Property1>Workshop Production</>, <Assistant_Property1>Market Acquisition</>, <Assistant_Property1>Railway Tycoon</>, and other gameplay.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain: </>\nBeyonders with an Acting Level > 19 can unlock the castle by completing the Miracle Castle quest. Click <Assistant_System>Menu-Castle</> to return to the castle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Castle Upgrade Conditions: </>\n1. The current castle can be upgraded (the maximum castle level gradually opens based on the number of days the server has been live).\n2. <Assistant_Property2>Total Castle Rating</> (sum of castle component ratings) reaches the specified rating. \n3. <Assistant_Property2>Castle Construction Rating</> (sum of ratings of components actually placed in the castle) reaches the specified rating.\n4. After meeting the above conditions, consume a certain amount of <Assistant_Property2>Castle Assets</> to upgrade. \n<Assistant_Title2>Purpose of Castle Assets: </>\n<Assistant_Property2>Castle Assets</> can be used to purchase furniture and for castle upgrade costs.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain Castle Assets: </>\n1. Quest Rewards—Complete <Assistant_Property1>Railway Tycoon</> quests to obtain Castle Assets.\n2. Market Acquisition—Beyonders can sell products produced by their castle workshop at other players' castles to obtain Castle Assets.\n<Assistant_Title2>Castle Asset Storage: </>\n1. There is a weekly cap on the assets a castle can obtain; assets exceeding the cap cannot be accumulated. Similarly, assets exceeding the castle's storage limit cannot be accumulated.\n2. The weekly obtainable assets and the castle asset storage limit will increase along with the castle level.",
